"><li class=\"card pred-tip\"><span class=\"num pred-tip-n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"pred-tip-title\">Trust the betting markets, but don’t copy them.</h3><p class=\"t-small m-0 mt-1.5\">Top-3 favourites usually deliver, but the #4-#10 range is where rankings re-shuffle wildly between jury and televote.</p></div></li><li class=\"card pred-tip\"><span class=\"num pred-tip-n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"pred-tip-title\">Worst 5 is where games are won.</h3><p class=\"t-small m-0 mt-1.5\">Most players over-think the top and ignore the bottom. Three correct Worst-5 picks are worth 60–150 points (20 each in the list, 50 each at the exact position).</p></div></li><li class=\"card pred-tip\"><span class=\"num pred-tip-n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"pred-tip-title\">Watch the semi-final running order.</h3><p class=\"t-small m-0 mt-1.5\">Late slots in the second semi tend to make grand-final spots they don’t deserve — they’re fresh in jury memory.</p></div></li><li class=\"card pred-tip\"><span class=\"num pred-tip-n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"pred-tip-title\">Don’t bet against the host.</h3><p class=\"t-small m-0 mt-1.5\">Host countries rarely win, but they rarely finish last either.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><details class=\"card fold pred-detail\"><summary class=\"fold-sum\"><span class=\"flex-1\">In detail: the format and the scoring</span><svg class=\"fold-chev\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"fold-body pred-detail-body\"><section class=\"cs\"><h2 class=\"t-h2 text-stage-text\">Prediction format</h2><div class=\"cs-body\"><p>Each player builds two lists once the host has started the party (predictions open as soon as the Grand Final line-up is confirmed):</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5\"><li><strong>Top 5</strong> — <!-- -->five countries you think will finish highest in the combined jury + televote.</li><li><strong>Worst 5</strong> — <!-- -->five countries you think will finish lowest.</li></ul><p>Lists are <strong>ordered</strong>: a #1 pick that wins scores more than a #5 pick that wins. You cannot put the same country in both lists. Lists stay editable through the songs and lock automatically when voting opens and the room moves to Voting Live.</p></div></section><section class=\"cs\"><h2 class=\"t-h2 text-stage-text\">Scoring — Top 5</h2><div class=\"cs-body\"><p>For each Top-5 pick, you score against the official combined jury + televote ranking:</p><div class=\"dt-card\"><table role=\"table\" class=\"dt\"><thead role=\"rowgroup\"><tr role=\"row\"><th role=\"columnheader\">Result</th><th role=\"columnheader\" class=\"dt-r\">Points</th></tr></thead><tbody role=\"rowgroup\"><tr role=\"row\"><td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Result\">Country at the exact position you predicted</td><td role=\"cell\" class=\"dt-r dt-num\" data-label=\"Points\"><strong class=\"text-stage-text\">50</strong></td></tr><tr role=\"row\"><td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Result\">Country in the official Top 5 but at a different position</td><td role=\"cell\" class=\"dt-r dt-num\" data-label=\"Points\"><strong class=\"text-stage-text\">20</strong></td></tr><tr role=\"row\"><td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Result\">Country outside the Top 5</td><td role=\"cell\" class=\"dt-r dt-num\" data-label=\"Points\"><span class=\"text-stage-text-3\">0</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Maximum Top-5 points: 5 exact positions × 50 = <strong>250</strong>.</p></div></section><section class=\"cs\"><h2 class=\"t-h2 text-stage-text\">Scoring — Worst 5</h2><div class=\"cs-body\"><p>Worst-5 is symmetrical — last place counts as position 1 in your list:</p><div class=\"dt-card\"><table role=\"table\" class=\"dt\"><thead role=\"rowgroup\"><tr role=\"row\"><th role=\"columnheader\">Result</th><th role=\"columnheader\" class=\"dt-r\">Points</th></tr></thead><tbody role=\"rowgroup\"><tr role=\"row\"><td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Result\">Country at the exact bottom position you predicted</td><td role=\"cell\" class=\"dt-r dt-num\" data-label=\"Points\"><strong class=\"text-stage-text\">50</strong></td></tr><tr role=\"row\"><td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Result\">Country in the official Worst 5 but at a different position</td><td role=\"cell\" class=\"dt-r dt-num\" data-label=\"Points\"><strong class=\"text-stage-text\">20</strong></td></tr><tr role=\"row\"><td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Result\">Country outside the Worst 5</td><td role=\"cell\" class=\"dt-r dt-num\" data-label=\"Points\"><span class=\"text-stage-text-3\">0</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Maximum Worst-5 points: 250. Combined predictions cap: <strong>500</strong>.</p></div></section></div></details><section class=\"cs\"><h2 class=\"t-h2 text-stage-text\">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class=\"cs-body\"><div class=\"acc\"><div class=\"acc-item\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-0\" class=\"acc-btn\"><span class=\"acc-q\">Can I change my list?</span><span class=\"acc-ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"acc-item\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-1\" class=\"acc-btn\"><span class=\"acc-q\">What about semi-final exits?</span><span class=\"acc-ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"acc-item\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expande